  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Recall the formula of root mean&nbsp;square speed,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mi>M</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math>,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><msub><mi>M</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>RMS</mi></msub></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mfenced><msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mi>RMS</mi></msub></mfenced><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>160</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>640</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mtext>m&#160;s</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>"
